 "sentence_source": "generated"}, {"text": "高圧が続くと、ガラスの容器でも割れることがある。", "target_word": "高圧", "complexity_tier": "T3", "furigana": "高圧[こうあつ]が続[つづ]くと、ガラスの容器[ようき]でも割[わ]れることがある。", "sentence_source": "generated"}], "morphological_forms": [{"form": "高圧", "label": "base"}, {"form": "高圧の", "label": "attributive"}, {"form": "高圧になる", "label": "resultative"}], "register": "neutral", "sense_fingerprint": "圧力が非常に高い状態(容器・水・ガス・深海などの高い圧力)", "collocate_grounding": {"status": "no_source", "reason": "no collocate asserted for this sense"}}'::jsonb, 'claude-code:fat-seed', 'v1', true, NULL, NULL, '9b8ac3e6-a2ff-4eb9-b4fb-6cf755747119') ON CONFLICT (sense_id, asset_type) DO UPDATE SET content = EXCLUDED.content, model_used = EXCLUDED.model_used, prompt_version = EXCLUDED.prompt_version, is_valid = EXCLUDED.is_valid, validation_errors = EXCLUDED.validation_errors, validation_warnings = EXCLUDED.validation_warnings, generation_batch_id = EXCLUDED.generation_batch_id;
